.TH NABU-REFIND 8 "August 2026" "SENEMOS" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
nabu-refind \- manage the packaged Nabu rEFInd application on the ESP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nabu-refind
.RI { install | update | status | version }
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B nabu-refind
installs or inspects the rEFInd application supplied by
.BR nabu-boot-refind .
The install and update commands copy the pinned AArch64 EFI application,
Nabu 2x dark theme, GopRotate driver, and generated configuration to the
mounted EFI System Partition. Android and the explicit known-good SENEMOS
fallback are preserved and verified.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B install
Perform the guarded initial synchronization to the ESP.
.TP
.B update
Synchronize the installed package payload to the ESP.
.TP
.B status
Report the packaged version and compare required ESP artifacts.
.TP
.B version
Print the packaged upstream rEFInd version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /boot/efi/EFI/BOOT/BOOTAA64.EFI
Firmware removable-media rEFInd application.
.TP
.I /boot/efi/EFI/BOOT/refind.conf
Generated Nabu rEFInd configuration.
.TP
.I /var/lib/nabu-boot-maintenance/refind-sync.pending
Deferred synchronization request created by RPM updates.
